                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Need to answer \"why\" in your commit message.\n\nFWIW, the sd-bus version of these have been exposed for some time (but weren't available when this code was written).  I would much rather see we transition to those than try to continue changing something that shouldn't exist in the first place.  Is that something you're interested in?\n\nhttps://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/26b2085d54ebbfca8637362eafcb4a8e3faf832f/src/systemd/sd-bus.h#L34"
                },
